WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:04.670
So I often get asked if there's a person or
company out there that I find inspiring

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:08.140
who I think is out there helping others and
work in a unique and special way.

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:10.370
And the answer is, 
of course, of course, of course.

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:15.650
One of my favorite examples is Spanx,
founded by Sara Blakely.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.179
Sara's completely reinventing how business
works.

00:00:18.179 --> 00:00:20.700
She's bringing this balanced feminine energy
into business,

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:23.220
things like caring, empathy, patience.

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:26.084
But what I love about what Sara is doing for
her people,

00:00:26.084 --> 00:00:28.619
is she treats everyone like an entrepreneur.

00:00:28.619 --> 00:00:31.970
Entrepreneurs generally start business
and know nothing about what they're doing and

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:34.220
have to figure it out along the way.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:37.600
Sara tells all of her employees: 
pretend you're an entrepreneur and

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:39.900
pretend you have no idea how to do this job

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:42.620
and you have to figure it out
along the way.

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:46.400
And what ends up happening is the people in
her company are finding

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.131
new ways to do old jobs better

00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:51.080
because they're treating it as
if it's an entrepreneurial venture.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:55.400
Like there are no rules here, 
that I can figure out how to get this job done

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.900
in a way that I think is new and better,

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:00.079
instead of worrying about 
have I learned the right things.

00:01:00.079 --> 00:01:05.420
And Spanx has been a hugely inspiring company
both internally and externally.

00:01:05.420 --> 00:01:08.850
And I love learning from Sara and from all
the things that she's doing.

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:12.030
So Spanx is is a great example of a company
doing things differently.

